Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "ConstructionEquipmentObstacle" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Large excavator bucket extending into the active lane" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of collision with heavy construction machinery encroaching on driving path" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential for high-impact collision with heavy construction equipment (excavator bucket) that is not clearly delineated or is partially occluding the lane in low-light conditions.
Severity Score: 0.90